Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 701 "[Lemegeton] The door to the other world"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900219000
    Collect 1 of 900220000

Requires (player level >= 70 and player is karus and quest 699 is completed) or (player level >= 70 and player is elmorad and quest 700 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "I thought they would be stronger considering the name and all. How pathetic! Huhuhu. Let's report it to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I thought they would be stronger considering the name and all. How pathetic! Huhuhu. Let's report it to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [24Devil] Naberius and [48Devil] Haagenti."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [24Devil] Naberius and [48Devil] Haagenti."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "It is now time to eliminate devils in the other world. We must first fight [60Devil] Vapula and [72Devil] Andromalius then [36Devil] Storas, the crow's noble. Be fully prepared for they are strong and have many men."
